NOTE ON BUNDLED FONTS

The TrueType font files under assets/fonts/ are NOT covered by the MIT
license above. They are distributed under the SIL Open Font License (OFL)
version 1.1. The full text of OFL 1.1 is in OFL.txt in the root of this
package.

In short, OFL allows:
  - Free use, including commercial use
  - Redistribution as part of any software (free or proprietary)
  - Modification (with naming restrictions on derivatives)

But forbids:
  - Selling the font files standalone
  - Using "Liberation" as the name of a modified font

If you need to ship the wrapper code without the bundled fonts, copy
the src/ tree (MIT) and skip the assets/fonts/ tree (OFL).
